  "fullDescription": "JUST BROWSING? CHECK OUT MY ENTIRE SHOP – CREATIVE WOLF DESIGN\n\nThis set of 8 seamless patterns includes adorable designs with gingerbread elements (trees, stockings, hearts, gingermen, mittens, stars and candycanes), christmas candy and cute lettering, as well as candycane stripes, polka dots and snowflakes.\n\nThe cute patterns in shades on red, pink, blue and tan are perfect for the Holiday season and allow you to easily mix and match them for your creative projects. You can use these for scrapbooking and other paper crafts, christmas home decor, small business marketing and packaging materials, wallpaper, wrapping paper and more.\n\nThis product comes in 1 Zipped folder (36.9 MB) and includes:\n\n• High Quality SEAMLESS Digital Paper Patterns\n• High Resolution, at 300 dpi\n• Each file is 12 x 12 inches (305 x 305 mm) or 3600 x 3600 pixels\n\n* 8 PNG files in RGB – Ideal for digital use\n* 8 JPEG files in CMYK – Ideal for printing\n\nPLEASE NOTE:\n• For better results, use the JPEG files for printing, and the PNG files for digital use\n• Colours may vary due to different screen and printer settings\n\nThank you for stopping by!",
